Package: libxr-hexagonrpc-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: XR FastRPC static client development files
 Independently maintained XR component for openKylin integration.

Package: xr-hexagonrpc-source
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: XR FastRPC source input for Bionic compatibility builds
 Independently maintained XR component for openKylin integration.

Package: xr-hexagonrpc-daemon
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: XR FastRPC listener and private process-domain host
 Provides shared DSP file services and opt-in client plugins. Installing this
 package does not start a DSP process or acquire camera hardware.
